      "note": [
        "The figures for 2024 are based on preliminary annual estimations of the national accounts.",
        "GDP at market prices for the period 2001-2024 was published 2026-02-27.",
        "There is a break in the time series for long-term care (HC.3). Data for the years 2001–2010 include only the medical component. From 2011 onwards, the definition of health care was broadened, resulting in a break in the time series for both HC.3 and total expenditure in health care (HC.0–HC.7)."
